 class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为电机转子惯量。</p>\n<p><strong>扭矩裕度设计</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>motor</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>load,max</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{\\text{motor}} \\cdot i \\cdot \\eta \\geq \\tau_{\\text{load,max}} \\cdot k_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">motor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">load,max</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 为传动效率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为安全系数（通常取1.5~2.0）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"新型驱动技术\">新型驱动技术</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>串联弹性驱动器（SEA）</strong>：在电机输出端串联弹性元件，通过弹簧变形间接测量力矩，广泛用于协作机器人</li>\n<li><strong>准直驱（Quasi-Direct Drive）</strong>：低减速比（6:1~10:1）搭配高扭矩电机，兼顾力控性能和扭矩输出</li>\n<li><strong>人工肌肉</strong>：基于形状记忆合金、介电弹性体或气动McKibben肌肉的仿生驱动</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2025-2026年，驱动器技术正经历深刻变革。人形机器人的爆发式增长推动了高扭矩密度电机的研发竞赛——宇树科技的 Unitree H1 采用准直驱方案实现了全身26个自由度的力控运动，单关节峰值扭矩达到 360 Nm。</p>\n<p>国产谐波减速器品牌（绿的谐波、来福谐波）在精度和寿命上已接近日本 Harmonic Drive 的水平，成本降低50%以上。此外，基于碳纤维柔轮的新一代谐波减速器将传动效率提升至90%以上。</p>\n<p>液压驱动在重载场景中重获关注。Boston Dynamics 的 Atlas 虽然已转向电驱动，但 Sanctuary AI 的 Phoenix 等产品证明液压系统在高功率密度需求下仍具不可替代性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某机器人关节需要在0.5秒内将2kg负载（臂长0.3m）加速到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> rad/s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\text{ rad/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> rad/s</span></span></span></span></span></span>，计算所需的峰值关节扭矩，并选择合适的电机+减速器组合。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较谐波减速器和行星减速器在协作机器人关节中的适用性，从精度、刚度、反向驱动性和成本四个维度分析。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么人形机器人倾向于使用准直驱方案而非高减速比方案。力控带宽与减速比有什么关系？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个串联弹性驱动器的力矩测量原理：如果弹簧刚度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext> Nm/rad</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K = 500 \\text{ Nm/rad}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Nm/rad</span></span></span></span></span></span>，要测量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.01</mn><mtext> Nm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.01 \\text{ Nm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Nm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 分辨率的力矩，编码器需要多少分辨率？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>驱动器与传动系统的选型和匹配是机器人设计中最关键的工程决策之一。从高精度工业场景到高动态仿人运动，不同应用对驱动方案提出了截然不同的要求。理解各类驱动器和传动机构的性能边界，掌握系统级匹配设计方法，是机器人工程师的核心竞争力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"驱动器与传动系统","id":"驱动器与传动系统"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"驱动器概述与分类","id":"驱动器概述与分类"},{"level":3,"text":"直流无刷电机（BLDC）","id":"直流无刷电机-bldc"},{"level":3,"text":"直驱电机技术","id":"直驱电机技术"},{"level":3,"text":"谐波减速器","id":"谐波减速器"},{"level":3,"text":"行星减速器","id":"行星减速器"},{"level":3,"text":"摆线针轮减速器","id":"摆线针轮减速器"},{"level":3,"text":"驱动系统匹配设计","id":"驱动系统匹配设计"},{"level":3,"text":"新型驱动技术","id":"新型驱动技术"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"机器人机构学与运动学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/mechanical-design-fundamentals/robot-mechanisms-kinematics"},"next":{"title":"结构设计与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/mechanical-design-fundamentals/structural-design-optimization"}}